    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Romega PM Weekly Status Drafter\n\n**Schedule:** every Friday at 08:00 UTC = 16:00 PHT.\n\n**What it does:** POSTs to `/api/pm/status-drafter/generate?week=current`. That endpoint aggregates the current week's weekly reports, attendance, and timesheets, calls Groq once for a stakeholder-ready summary, and upserts one row into `status_drafts`.\n\n**Required env vars** on this n8n container:\n- `APP_BASE_URL` — public URL of the Romega app\n- `N8N_BRIEFING_SECRET` — same shared secret used by the app\n\n**Run behavior:** cached if the row already exists unless the endpoint is called with `force=1`.\n",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 490
      },
      "id": "pm-sticky",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [240, 468]
    }
